<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ascend upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it raised its rating on Ascend Communications Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- raised its 1997 earnings estimate to $1.62 a share from $1.40, and raised its 1998 estimate to $2.10 from $1.85.</p>
<p>-- Ascend was up 4-5/8 at 73-1/2 in morning trading.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
